					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: CIRCULATING AR'S\n\nIn this example we are using the Circulate node to trigger 10 Attack Release node's, one at a time.\nThe AR node always runs from 0 to 1.\nWe had to reduce this to make the patch look good, so a Map node was added to map the values to a suitable range."
					}
				},
